.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pkcs11-register \- Simple tool to install PKCS#11 modules to known applications\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBpkcs11\-register\fR\ 'u
\fBpkcs11\-register\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBpkcs11\-register\fR
utility can be used from the command line to register PKCS#11 modules to various applications
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
.RS 4
Print help message on screen\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
.RS 4
Print the OpenSC package release version\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-module\fR \fIfilename\fR, \fB\-m\fR \fIfilename\fR
.RS 4
Path to the PKCS#11 module to load\&. The default is OpenSC PKCS#11 module\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-skip\-chrome\fR
.RS 4
Don\*(Aqt install module for Chrome browser\&. By default, the tool attempts to install the module for Chrome browser\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-skip\-firefox\fR
.RS 4
Don\*(Aqt install module for Firefox browser\&. By default, the tool attempts to install the module for Firefox browser\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-skip\-thunderbird\fR
.RS 4
Don\*(Aqt install module for Thunderbird mail client\&. By default, the tool attempts to install the module for Thunderbird mail client\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-skip\-seamonkey\fR
.RS 4
Don\*(Aqt install module for Seamonkey\&. By default, the tool attempts to install the module Seamonkey\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBpkcs11-tool\fR(1)
\fBopensc.conf\fR(5)
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBpkcs11\-register\fR
was written by Frank Morgner
<frankmorgner@gmail\&.com>\&.
